  plumbing, hairline batch, GLSL library and post from its engine/gl.ts, lines.ts, glsl/common.ts and post.ts),
  kit/anim.js (the time helpers of its engine/util.ts) and in docs/MUSIC-SYNC.md and docs/GPU.md (the rules and
